WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.040
Carthage, the year 250.

2
00:00:03.090 --> 00:00:07.570
The emperor orders everyone in the
empire to sacrifice to the gods.

3
00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:10.660
Each person must get a
certificate to prove it.

4
00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:12.480
Many Christians give way.

5
00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:14.400
Some offer sacrifice.

6
00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:17.590
Some simply bribe an
official for the certificate.

7
00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:20.960
When the danger passes, many
of them want to come back.

8
00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:24.440
Thousands denied their
faith to save their lives.

9
00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:26.550
Should the church take them back?

10
00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:29.790
In this mission, you'll meet
Cyprian, bishop of Carthage,

11
00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:32.490
caught between two opposing parties.

12
00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:36.130
Then you'll see why he believed
the church must stay one,

13
00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:38.850
and how that led to a clash with Rome.

14
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:43.230
Your mission: find out how Cyprian
answered the question of the lapsed.
